<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IBM EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IBM EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it cut International Business Machines Corp's 1997 earnings estimates to $12.35 a share from $12.75 a share and trimmed the 1998 estimates to $14.20 a share from $14.60 a share based on &quot;currency effects.&quot;</p>
<p>-- IBM lost 3-5/8 to 145-1/4.</p>
</text>
